  <section class="section scheme-light" aria-labelledby="found-title">
    <div class="container split-rows">
      <div class="ai-def">
        <h2 class="h2" id="found-title" data-split>What did the audit find?</h2>
        <div class="text-lg prose" data-reveal>
          <p>A few of the findings, area by area:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Design system.</strong> The same UI role appeared in several unrelated accent colours, and all colour came from users' cover art. The fix: one colour system, one button set, and real loading, empty and error states.</li>
            <li><strong>Onboarding.</strong> "Step 1 / 2" had no clear total and "Generating…" set no time frame. We recommended visible progress, honest waits and a value showcase before the paywall.</li>
            <li><strong>Create.</strong> Every create made two near-identical episodes, explained nowhere before purchase, which also made the weekly quota misleading.</li>
            <li><strong>Narration.</strong> The consent step named only an uploaded voice, not a recorded one, and deleting a voice was unclear and unrecoverable.</li>
            <li><strong>Paywall.</strong> No in-app way to cancel, discount maths instead of value, and the selected plan was hard to see.</li>
            <li><strong>Website and store.</strong> Three palettes across app, website and store, and website text that failed WCAG AA contrast.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
