            <li><strong>A video walkthrough</strong> of the full report: <a class="text-link" href="https://youtu.be/a6h4D_BZkbM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">watch it on YouTube</a>.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>An audit that ends at findings is a complaint. This one ends in a plan the team can take straight into a sprint. Want one for your app? See our <a class="text-link" href="/ux-audit/">UX audit service</a>.</p>
        </div>
